# Paths a folder scan of this repository (`aka scan .`, the dashboard's Scan
# page, `/aka:scan`) skips. This tree deliberately carries thousands of
# secret-shaped and PII-shaped values as test data; scanning them buries any
# real finding under self-inflicted noise.
#
# Matches are HARD-SKIPPED: the file is never read, so it yields no event and
# no finding. Every entry below therefore names data whose secret-shaped
# content is intentional. Product source stays scanned, and so does anything a
# real credential could land in (`.env*`, docs, hand-written scripts).
#
# Only the folder scans read this file — the live hooks (prompts, tool input,
# tool output, history backfill) do not. Patterns are relative to this
# directory, and a scan aimed at a subdirectory does not read it at all, so
# scan from the repository root.
#
# packages/local-ops/test/repo-akaignore.test.ts drives the real file walker
# over the tracked tree with this file and pins what it skips and what it keeps.

# Detection-rule examples and fixtures: each holds the exact patterns its rule
# targets. GitHub secret scanning excludes the same tree
# (.github/secret_scanning.yml).
rules/

# Fixture data that lives under a package's `src/` because a built suite or a
# bundled module loads it: egress-extraction and posture samples, and the
# persistence sample datasets and corpus generator.
packages/detections/src/egress/fixtures/
packages/detections/src/posture/fixtures/
packages/persistence/src/test-fixtures/

# Test fixture trees in every package, plus the repo-root shared corpus.
**/test/fixtures/
# ...except the browser extension's. Raw web-chat captures recorded there
# (`*.har`, `*.raw.json`) are real conversations that can carry auth headers —
# .gitignore keeps them out of git, and this keeps them visible to a scan.
!plugins/browser-extension/test/fixtures/

# Benchmark suites and the corpora they generate.
**/bench/

# Gitignored build output. Each bundle inlines the detection packs, every
# rule's examples included.
plugins/claude-code/scripts/
plugins/codex/scripts/
plugins/antigravity/scripts/
plugins/copilot/scripts/
plugins/browser-extension/native-host/
*.tsbuildinfo
